    /**
     * Normalizes a URI path by ensuring it has exactly one leading slash.
     * <p>
     * The original implementation only removed excess leading slashes but
     * failed to guarantee that a path starts with a slash. This could cause
     * malformed URIs where the path is interpreted as a host or other
